Z||000003||WisconsinGT||04-23-2000||08:28 PM||||Gokart, I am still playing with the idea of getting A.I.S. from RSM. (My stock engine has seen it's better days.Don't know if I should put anymore money into it.) I sent e-mail to them asking if they have a setup for the 2.8 Fiero. Here is the reply....<P>We have the systems for many different cars including the 2.8 Fiero. The<BR>system is $(US)177.00 including addapters, 3" polished aluminum piping and<BR>K&N cone filter.<P>Regards<P>Zsolt<BR>RS Motorsport<P>Hope this helps.||||reg||1
